    "updated_at": "2023-11-01T19:40:47Z",
    "body": "Slight preference for referring to the parsed state rather than tokens in the input, but I could live with any of those. I think `hasRegExpGroups` is my narrow favorite, with `requiresRegExp` as a runner-up.",
